  "description": "TUnit-native tolerance-aware numeric assertions over the MathAssertions core. v0.0.1 ships a single fluent entry point: .IsApproximatelyEqualTo(expected, tolerance) on Vector3, generated via TUnit's [GenerateAssertion]. The wider System.Numerics catalog (Vector2/4, Quaternion rotational equivalence, Matrix4x4, Plane, Complex, double[]/float[]) lands at 0.1.0. Extensible: consumers add tolerance assertions for their own domain types via [GenerateAssertion] extensions calling MathTolerance helpers. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no reflection.",
